OL,3,GNEWSA'Migrant taxi service' smuggler
OL,4,Adeported from UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ukrainian national convicted of
OL,7,Fpeople-smuggling offences on a #15,000
OL,8,F($20,000) yacht has been deported after
OL,9,Fserving part of a six-year prison
OL,10,Fsentence.
OL,12,FThe Home Office said Vladyslav
OL,13,FCherniavskyi, who was jailed at
OL,14,FPortsmouth Crown Court on 12 March, was
OL,15,Fremoved from the UK in September.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
