OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Migrant taxi service' smuggler
OL,4,Adeported from UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn July 2025, he and another Ukrainian
OL,7,Fman, Oleksandr Yavtushenko, were
OL,8,Fconvicted of plotting to smuggle
OL,9,Fmigrants into the UK on the boat from
OL,10,Fnorthern France, which was found by a
OL,11,FBorder Force cutter off the Isle of
OL,12,FWight.
OL,14,FMinister of State for Border Security
OL,15,Fand Asylum Anna Turley said
OL,16,FCherniavskyi's deportation "sends a
OL,17,Fclear message [that] foreign criminals
OL,18,Fwho break our laws will be removed".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
